          "note": "Martin McDonagh writes and directs; John Malkovich and Sam Rockwell as aging CIA officers on Easter Island before the 1973 Chilean coup. A top-five-of-the-year pick for both hosts; Sean's read is 'JFK Rewatchables in a movie theater.'"
