        {
          "title": "Possible Love",
          "year": 2026,
          "note": "Lee Chang-dong's first film since Burning (2018), on Netflix. Two couples from different stations, a documentary within the film, the Korean class divide. Both hosts admire the moment-to-moment craft but feel every minute of the 2h45m and find the ending too diagrammatic."
        }
      ]
