          "title": "Once Upon a Time in Harlem",
          "year": 2026,
          "note": "Documentary begun by William Greaves from a 1972 gathering of Harlem Renaissance artists at Duke Ellington's apartment; finished 50 years later by his son David (a cameraman that day) and editor Anne DeMare after restoring and hand-syncing four cameras of footage."
